('spell_summon_dragon','Summon Dragon',5,'conjuration','action','ranged',60,1,1,1,'an object with a dragon image engraved on it worth 500+ GP','concentration_1_hour',1,0,'You call forth a Dragon spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space within range and uses the Draconic Spirit stat block. It is an ally, shares your Initiative, and obeys verbal commands. You choose one of its Resistances to gain for yourself until the spell ends. Disappears at 0 HP or when the spell ends. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot: Use the slot level for the stat block''s level.',null,null,null,1,null,null,null,null,null,null,'single',null,null,0,1);
