('spell_summon_elemental','Summon Elemental',4,'conjuration','action','ranged',90,1,1,1,'air, a pebble, ash, and water inside a gold-inlaid vial worth 400+ GP','concentration_1_hour',1,0,'You call forth an Elemental spirit (Air, Earth, Fire, or Water — your choice). It manifests in an unoccupied space within range and uses the Elemental Spirit stat block. It is an ally, shares your Initiative, and obeys verbal commands. Disappears at 0 HP or when the spell ends. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot: Use the slot level for the stat block''s level.',null,null,null,1,null,null,null,null,null,null,'single',null,null,0,1);
