('spell_summon_fey','Summon Fey',3,'conjuration','action','ranged',90,1,1,1,'a gilded flower worth 300+ GP','concentration_1_hour',1,0,'You call forth a Fey spirit (Fuming, Mirthful, or Tricksy — your choice of mood). It manifests in an unoccupied space within range and uses the Fey Spirit stat block. It is an ally, shares your Initiative, and obeys verbal commands. As a Bonus Action it can Fey Step (teleport 30 feet) with a mood-based effect. Disappears at 0 HP or when the spell ends. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot: Use the slot level for the stat block''s level.',null,null,null,1,null,null,null,null,null,null,'single',null,null,0,1);
