('spell_summon_fiend','Summon Fiend',6,'conjuration','action','ranged',90,1,1,1,'a bloody vial worth 600+ GP','concentration_1_hour',1,0,'You call forth a fiendish spirit (Demon, Devil, or Yugoloth — your choice). It manifests in an unoccupied space within range and uses the Fiendish Spirit stat block. It is an ally, shares your Initiative, and obeys verbal commands. Disappears at 0 HP or when the spell ends. Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot: Use the slot level for the stat block''s level.',null,null,null,1,null,null,null,null,null,null,'single',null,null,0,1);
